{"H8300":{"lemma":"שָׂרִיד","xlit":"sârîyd","pron":"saw-reed'","from":"from H8277 (שָׂרַד);","def":"a survivor","kjv":"[idiom] alive, left, remain(-ing), remnant, rest.","count":28},"H8301":{"lemma":"שָׂרִיד","xlit":"Sârîyd","pron":"suw-reed'","from":"the same as H8300 (שָׂרִיד);","def":"Sarid, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Sarid.","count":2},"H8302":{"lemma":"שִׁרְיוֹן","xlit":"shiryôwn","pron":"shir-yone'","from":"or שִׁרְיֹן; and שִׁרְיָן; also (feminine) שִׁרְיָה; and שִׁרְיֹנָה; from H8281 (שָׁרָה) in the original sense of turning;","def":"a corslet (as if twisted)","kjv":"breastplate, coat of mail, habergeon, harness. See H5630 (סִרְיֹן).","count":9},"H8303":{"lemma":"שִׁרְיוֹן","xlit":"Shiryôwn","pron":"shir-yone'","from":"and שִׂרְיֹן; the same as H8304 (שְׂרָיָה) (i.e. sheeted with snow);","def":"Shirjon or Sirjon, a peak of the Lebanon","kjv":"Sirion.","count":2},"H8304":{"lemma":"שְׂרָיָה","xlit":"Sᵉrâyâh","pron":"ser-aw-yaw'","from":"or שְׂרָיָהוּ; from H8280 (שָׂרָה) and H3050 (יָהּ); Jah has prevailed;","def":"Serajah, the name of nine Israelites","kjv":"Seraiah.","count":20},"H8305":{"lemma":"שְׂרִיקָה","xlit":"sᵉrîyqâh","pron":"ser-ee-kaw'","from":"from the same as H8321 (שֹׂרֵק) in the original sense of piercing;","def":"hetchelling (or combing flax), i.e. (concretely) tow (by extension, linen cloth)","kjv":"fine.","count":1},"H8306":{"lemma":"שָׁרִיר","xlit":"shârîyr","pron":"shaw-reer'","from":"from H8324 (שָׁרַר) in the original sense as in H8270 (שֹׁר) (compare H8326 (שֹׁרֶר));","def":"a cord, i.e. (by analogy) sinew","kjv":"navel.","count":1},"H8307":{"lemma":"שְׁרִירוּת","xlit":"shᵉrîyrûwth","pron":"sher-ee-rooth'","from":"from H8324 (שָׁרַר) in the sense of twisted, i.e. firm;","def":"obstinacy","kjv":"imagination, lust.","count":10},"H8308":{"lemma":"שָׂרַךְ","xlit":"sârak","pron":"saw-rak'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to interlace","kjv":"traverse.","count":1},"H8309":{"lemma":"שְׁרֵמָה","xlit":"shᵉrêmâh","pron":"sher-ay-maw'","from":"