l or in scorn)","kjv":"hiss.","count":12},"H8320":{"lemma":"שָׂרֻק","xlit":"sâruq","pron":"saw-rook'","from":"from H8319 (שָׁרַק);","def":"bright red (as piercing to the sight), i.e. bay","kjv":"speckled. See H8291 (שָׂרוּק).","count":1},"H8321":{"lemma":"שֹׂרֵק","xlit":"sôrêq","pron":"so-rake'","from":"or שׂוֹרֵק; and (feminine) שֹׂרֵקָה; from H8319 (שָׁרַק) in the sense of redness (compare H8320 (שָׂרֻק));","def":"a vine stock (properly, one yielding purple grapes, the richest variety)","kjv":"choice(-st, noble) wine. Compare H8291 (שָׂרוּק).","count":3},"H8322":{"lemma":"שְׁרֵקָה","xlit":"shᵉrêqâh","pron":"sher-ay-kaw'","from":"from H8319 (שָׁרַק);","def":"a derision","kjv":"hissing.","count":7},"H8323":{"lemma":"שָׂרַר","xlit":"sârar","pron":"saw-rar'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to have (transitively, exercise; reflexively, get) dominion","kjv":"[idiom] altogether, make self a prince, (bear) rule.","count":5},"H8324":{"lemma":"שָׁרַר","xlit":"shârar","pron":"shaw-rar'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to be hostile (only active participle an opponent)","kjv":"enemy.","count":5},"H8325":{"lemma":"שָׁרַר","xlit":"Shârar","pron":"shaw-rawr'","from":"from H8324 (שָׁרַר); hostile;","def":"Sharar, an Israelite","kjv":"Sharar.","count":1},"H8326":{"lemma":"שֹׁרֶר","xlit":"shôrer","pron":"sho'-rer","from":"from H8324 (שָׁרַר) in the sense of twisting (compare H8270 (שֹׁר));","def":"the umbilical cord, i.e. (by extension) a bodice","kjv":"navel.","count":1},"H8327":{"lemma":"שָׁרַשׁ","xlit":"shârash","pron":"shaw-rash'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to root, i.e. strike into the soil, or (by implication) to pluck from it","kjv":"(take, cause to take) root (out).","count":8},"H8328":{"lemma":"שֶׁרֶשׁ","xlit":"sheresh","pron":"sheh'-resh","from":"from H8327 (שָׁרַשׁ);","def":"a root (literally or figuratively)","kjv":"bottom, deep, heel, root.","count":33},"H8329":{"lemma":"שֶׁרֶשׁ","xlit":"Sheresh","pron":"sheh'-resh","from":"the same as H8328 (שֶׁרֶשׁ);","def":"Sheresh, an Israelite","kjv":"Sharesh.","count":1},"H8330":{"lemma":"שֹׁרֶשׁ","xlit":"shôresh","pron":"sho'-resh","from":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H8328 (שֶׁרֶשׁ)","def":"{a root (literally or figuratively)}","kjv":"root.","count":3},"H8331":{"lemma":"שַׁרְשָׁה","xlit":"sharshâh","pron":"shar-shaw'","from":"from H8327 (שָׁרַשׁ);","def":"a chain (as rooted, i.e. linked)","kjv":"chain. Compare H8333 (שַׁרְשְׁרָה).","count":1},"H8332":{"lemma":"שְׁרֹשׁוּ","xlit":"shᵉrôshûw","pron":"sher-o-shoo'","from":"(Aramaic) from a root corresponding to H8327 (שָׁרַשׁ);","def":"eradication, i.e. (figuratively) exile","kjv":"banishment.","count":1},"H8333":{"lemma":"שַׁרְשְׁרָה","xlit":"sharshᵉrâh","pron":"shar-sher-aw'","from":"from H8327 (שָׁרַשׁ) (compare H8331 (שַׁרְשָׁה));","def":"a chain; (architectural) probably a garland","kjv":"chain.","count":7},"H8334":{"lemma":"שָׁרַת","xlit":"shârath","pron":"shaw-rath'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to attend as a menial or worshipper; figuratively, to contribute to","kjv":"minister (unto), (do) serve(-ant, -ice, -itor), wait on.","count":97},"H8335":{"lemma":"שָׁרֵת","xlit":"shârêth","pron":"shaw-rayth'","from":"infinitive of H8334 (שָׁרַת);","def":"service (in the Temple)","kjv":"minister(-ry).","count":2},"H8336":{"lemma":"שֵׁשׁ","xlit":"shêsh","pron":"shaysh","from":"or (for alliteration with H4897 (מֶשִׁי)) שְׁשִׁי; for H7893 (שַׁיִשׁ);","def":"bleached stuff, i.e. white linen or (by analogy) marble","kjv":"[idiom] blue, fine (twined) linen, marble, silk.","count":41},"H8337":{"lemma":"שֵׁשׁ","xlit":"shêsh","pron":"shaysh","from":"masculine שִׁשָּׁה; a primitive number; compare H7797 (שׂוּשׂ)","def":"six (as an overplus  beyond five or the fingers of the hand); as ord. sixth","kjv":"six(-teen, -teenth), sixth.","count":215},"H8338":{"lemma":"שָׁשָׁא","xlit":"shâshâʼ","pron":"shaw-shaw'","from":"a primitive root; apparently,","def":"to annihilate","kjv":"leave by the sixth part (by confusion with H8341 (שָׁשָׁה)).","count":1},"H8339":{"lemma":"שֵׁשְׁבַּצַּר","xlit":"Shêshᵉbatstsar","pron":"shaysh-bats-tsar'","from":"of foreign derivation;","def":"Sheshbatstsar, Zerubbabel's Persian name","kjv":"Sheshbazzar.","count":2},"H8340":{"lemma":"שֵׁשְׁבַּצַּר","xlit":"Shêshᵉbatstsar","pron":"shaysh-bats-tsar'","from":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H8339 (שֵׁשְׁבַּצַּר)","def":"{Sheshbatstsar, Zerubbabel's Persian name}","kjv":"Sheshbazzar.","count":2},"H8341":{"lemma":"שָׁשָׁה","xlit":"shâshâh","pron":"shaw-shaw'","from":"a denominative from H8337 (שֵׁשׁ);","def":"to sixth or divide into sixths","kjv":"give the sixth participle","count":1},"H8342":{"lemma":"שָׂשׂוֹן","xlit":"sâsôwn","pron":"saw-sone'","from":"or שָׂשֹׂן; from H7797 (שׂוּשׂ);","def":"cheerfulness; specifically, welcome","kjv":"gladness, joy, mirth, rejoicing.","count":22},"H8343":{"lemma":"שָׁשַׁי","xlit":"Shâshay","pron":"shaw-shah'-ee","from":"perhaps from H8336 (שֵׁשׁ); whitish;","def":"Shashai, an Israelite","kjv":"Shashai.","count":1},"H8344":{"lemma":"שֵׁשַׁי","xlit":"Shêshay","pron":"shay-shah'-ee","from":"probably for H8343 (שָׁשַׁי);","def":"Sheshai, a Canaanite","kjv":"Sheshai.","count":3},"H8345":{"lemma":"שִׁשִּׁי","xlit":"shishshîy","pron":"shish-shee'","from":"from H8337 (שֵׁשׁ);","def":"sixth, ord. or (feminine) fractional","kjv":"sixth (part).","count":28},"H8346":{"lemma":"שִׁשִּׁים","xlit":"shishshîym","pron":"shish-sheem'","from":"multiple of H8337 (שֵׁשׁ);","def":"sixty","kjv":"sixty, three score.","count":59},"H8347":{"lemma":"שֵׁשַׁךְ","xlit":"Shêshak","pron":"shay-shak'","from":"of foreign derivation;","def":"Sheshak, a symbolic name of Babylon","kjv":"Sheshach.","count":2},"H8348":{"lemma":"שֵׁשָׁן","xlit":"Shêshân","pron":"shay-shawn'","from":"perhaps for H7799 (שׁוּשַׁן); lily;","def":"Sheshan, an Israelite","kjv":"Sheshan.","count":5},"H8349":{"lemma":"שָׁשַׁק","xlit":"Shâshaq","pron":"shaw-shak'","from":"probably from the base of H7785 (שׁוֹק); pedestrian;","def":"Shashak, an Israelite","kjv":"Shashak.","count":2},"H8350":{"lemma":"שָׁשַׁר","xlit":"shâshar","pron":"shaw-shar'","from":"perhaps from the base of H8324 (שָׁרַר) in the sense of that of H8320 (שָׂרֻק);","def":"red ochre (from its piercing color)","kjv":"vermillion.","count":2},"H8351":{"lemma":"שֵׁת","xlit":"shêth","pron":"shayth","from":"(Numbers from H7582 (שָׁאָה);","def":"tumult","kjv":"Sheth.","count":0},"H8352":{"lemma":"שֵׁת","xlit":"Shêth","pron":"shayth","from":"from H7896 (שִׁית); put, i.e. substituted;","def":"Sheth, third son of Adam","kjv":"Seth, Sheth.","count":9},"H8353":{"lemma":"שֵׁת","xlit":"shêth","pron":"shayth","from":"(Aramaic) or שִׁת; (Aramaic), corresponding to H8337 (שֵׁשׁ);","def":"{six}","kjv":"six(-th).","count":2},"H8354":{"lemma":"שָׁתָה","xlit":"shâthâh","pron":"shaw-thaw'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to imbibe (literally or figuratively)","kjv":"[idiom] assuredly, banquet, [idiom] certainly, drink(-er, -ing), drunk ([idiom] -ard), surely. (Prop. intensive of H8248 (שָׁקָה).)","count":217},"H8355":{"lemma":"שְׁתָה","xlit":"shᵉthâh","pron":"sheth-aw'","from":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H8354 (שָׁתָה)","def":"{to imbibe (literally or figuratively)}","kjv":"drink.","count":5},"H8356":{"lemma":"שָׁתָה","xlit":"shâthâh","pron":"shaw-thaw'","from":"from H7896 (שִׁית);","def":"a basis, i.e. (figuratively) political or moral support","kjv":"foundation, purpose.","count":2},"H8357":{"lemma":"שֵׁתָה","xlit":"shêthâh","pron":"shay-thaw'","from":"from H7896 (שִׁית);","def":"the seat (of the person)","kjv":"buttock.","count":2},"H8358":{"lemma":"שְׁתִי","xlit":"shᵉthîy","pron":"sheth-ee'","from":"from H8354 (שָׁתָה);","def":"intoxicaion","kjv":"drunkenness.","count":1},"H8359":{"lemma":"שְׁתִי","xlit":"shᵉthîy","pron":"sheth-ee'","from":"from H7896 (שִׁית);","def":"a fixture, i.e. the warp in weaving","kjv":"warp.","count":9},"H8360":{"lemma":"שְׁתִיָּה","xlit":"shᵉthîyâh","pron":"sheth-ee-yaw'","from":"feminine of H8358 (שְׁתִי);","def":"potation","kjv":"drinking.","count":1},"H8361":{"lemma":"שִׁתִּין","xlit":"shittîyn","pron":"shit-teen'","from":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H8346 (שִׁשִּׁים) (compare H8353 (שֵׁת));","def":"sixty","kjv":"threescore.","count":4},"H8362":{"lemma":"שָׁתַל","xlit":"shâthal","pron":"shaw-thal'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to transplant","kjv":"plant.","count":10},"H8363":{"lemma":"שְׁתִל","xlit":"shᵉthil","pron":"sheth-eel'","from":"from H8362 (שָׁתַל);","def":"a sprig (as if transplanted), i.e. sucker","kjv":"plant.","count":1},"H8364":{"lemma":"שֻׁתַלְחִי","xlit":"Shuthalchîy","pron":"shoo-thal-kee'","from":"patronymically from H7803 (שׁוּתֶלַח);","def":"a Shuthalchite (collectively) or descendants of Shuthelach","kjv":"Shuthalhites.","count":1},"H8365":{"lemma":"שָׁתַם","xlit":"shâtham","pron":"shaw-tham'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to unveil (figuratively)","kjv":"be open.","count":2},"H8366":{"lemma":"שָׁתַן","xlit":"shâthan","pron":"shaw-than'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"(causatively) to make water, i.e. urinate","kjv":"piss.","count":6},"H8367":{"lemma":"שָׁתַק","xlit":"shâthaq","pron":"shaw-thak'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to subside","kjv":"be calm, cease, be quiet.","count":4},"H8368":{"lemma":"שָׂתַר","xlit":"sâthar","pron":"saw-thar'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to break out (as an eruption)","kjv":"have in (one's) secret parts.","count":1},"H8369":{"lemma":"שֵׁתָר","xlit":"Shêthâr","pron":"shay-thawr'","from":"of foreign derivation;","def":"Shethar, a Persian satrap","kjv":"Shethar.","count":1},"H8370":{"lemma":"שְׁתַר בּוֹזְנַי","xlit":"Shᵉthar Bôwzᵉnay","pron":"sheth-ar' bo-zen-ah'-ee","from":"of foreign derivation;","def":"Shethar-Bozenai, a Persian officer","kjv":"Shetharboznai.","count":8},"H8371":{"lemma":"שָׁתַת","xlit":"shâthath","pron":"shaw-thath'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to place, i.e. array; reflex. to lie","kjv":"be laid, set. t","count":2},"H8372":{"lemma":"תָּא","xlit":"tâʼ","pron":"taw","from":"and (feminine) תָּאָה; (Ezekiel 40:12), from (the base of) H8376 (תָּאָה);","def":"a room (as circumscribed)","kjv":"(little) chamber.","count":13},"H8373":{"lemma":"תָּאַב","xlit":"tâʼab","pron":"taw-ab'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to desire","kjv":"long.","count":2},"H8374":{"lemma":"תָּאַב","xlit":"tâʼab","pron":"taw-ab'","from":"a primitive root (probably identical with H8373 (תָּאַב) through the idea of puffing disdainfully at; compare H340 (אָיַב));","def":"to loathe (morally)","kjv":"abhor.","count":1},"H8375":{"lemma":"תַּאֲבָה","xlit":"taʼăbâh","pron":"tah-ab-aw'","from":"from H8374 (תָּאַב) (compare H15 (אָבֶה));","def":"desire","kjv":"longing.","count":1},"H8376":{"lemma":"תָּאָה","xlit":"tâʼâh","pron":"taw-aw'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to mark off, i.e. (intensively) designate","kjv":"point out.","count":2},"H8377":{"lemma":"תְּאוֹ","xlit":"tᵉʼôw","pron":"teh-o'","from":"and תּוֹא; (the original form), from H8376 (תָּאָה);","def":"a species of antelope (probably from the white stripe on the cheek)","kjv":"wild bull (ox).","count":2},"H8378":{"lemma":"תַּאֲוָה","xlit":"taʼăvâh","pron":"tah-av-aw'","from":"from H183 (אָוָה) (abbreviated);","def":"a longing; by implication, a delight (subjectively, satisfaction, objectively, a charm)","kjv":"dainty, desire, [idiom] exceedingly, [idiom] greedily, lust(ing), pleasant. See also H6914 (קִבְרוֹת הַתַּאֲוָה).","count":20},"H8379":{"lemma":"תַּאֲוָה","xlit":"taʼăvâh","pron":"tah-av-aw'","from":"from H8376 (תָּאָה);","def":"a limit, i.e. full extent","kjv":"utmost bound.","count":1},"H8380":{"lemma":"תָּאוֹם","xlit":"tâʼôwm","pron":"taw-ome'","from":"or תָּאֹם; from H8382 (תָּאַם);","def":"a twin (in plural only), literally or figuratively","kjv":"twins.","count":6},"H8381":{"lemma":"תַּאֲלָה","xlit":"taʼălâh","pron":"tah-al-aw'","from":"from H422 (אָלָה);","def":"an imprecation","kjv":"curse.","count":1},"H8382":{"lemma":"תָּאַם","xlit":"tâʼam","pron":"taw-am'","from":"a primitive root; to be complete; but used only as denominative from H8380 (תָּאוֹם),","def":"to be (causatively, make) twinned, i.e. (figuratively) duplicate or (architectural) jointed","kjv":"coupled (together), bear twins.","count":2},"H8383":{"lemma":"תְּאֻן","xlit":"tᵉʼun","pron":"teh-oon'","from":"from H205 (אָוֶן);","def":"naughtiness, i.e. toil","kjv":"lie.","count":1},"H8384":{"lemma":"תְּאֵן","xlit":"tᵉʼên","pron":"teh-ane'","from":"or (in the singular, feminine) תְּאֵנָה; perhaps of foreign derivation","def":"the fig (tree or fruit)","kjv":"fig (tree).","count":39},"H8385":{"lemma":"תַּאֲנָה","xlit":"taʼănâh","pron":"tah-an-aw'","from":"or תֹּאֲנָה; from H579 (אָנָה);","def":"an opportunity or (subjectively) purpose","kjv":"occasion.","count":2},"H8386":{"lemma":"תַּאֲנִיָּה","xlit":"taʼănîyâh","pron":"tah-an-ee-yaw'","from":"from H578 (אָנָה);","def":"lamentation","kjv":"heaviness, mourning.","count":2},"H8387":{"lemma":"תַּאֲנַת שִׁלֹה","xlit":"Taʼănath Shilôh","pron":"tah-an-ath' shee-lo'","from":"from H8385 (תַּאֲנָה) and H7887 (שִׁילֹה); approach of Shiloh;","def":"Taanath-Shiloh, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Taanath-shiloh.","count":2},"H8388":{"lemma":"תָּאַר","xlit":"tâʼar","pron":"taw-ar'","from":"a primitive root;","def":"to delineate; reflex. to extend","kjv":"be drawn, mark out, (Rimmon-) methoar (by union with H7417 (רִמּוֹן)).","count":8},"H8389":{"lemma":"תֹּאַר","xlit":"tôʼar","pron":"to'-ar","from":"from H8388 (תָּאַר);","def":"outline, i.e. figure or appearance","kjv":"[phrase] beautiful, [idiom] comely, countenance, [phrase] fair, [idiom] favoured, form, [idiom] goodly, [idiom] resemble, visage.","count":15},"H8390":{"lemma":"תַּאֲרֵעַ","xlit":"Taʼărêaʻ","pron":"tah-ar-ay'-ah","from":"perhaps from H772 (אֲרַע);","def":"Taarea, an Israelite","kjv":"Tarea. See H8475 (תַּחְרֵעַ).","count":1},"H8391":{"lemma":"תְּאַשּׁוּר","xlit":"tᵉʼashshûwr","pron":"teh-ash-shoor'","from":"from H833 (אָשַׁר);","def":"a species of cedar (from its erectness)","kjv":"box (tree).","count":2},"H8392":{"lemma":"תֵּבָה","xlit":"têbâh","pron":"tay-baw'","from":"perhaps of foreign derivation;","def":"a box","kjv":"ark.","count":28},"H8393":{"lemma":"תְּבוּאָה","xlit":"tᵉbûwʼâh","pron":"teb-oo-aw'","from":"from H935 (בּוֹא);","def":"income, i.e. produce (literally or figuratively)","kjv":"fruit, gain, increase, revenue.","count":42},"H8394":{"lemma":"תָּבוּן","xlit":"tâbûwn","pron":"taw-boon'","from":"and (feminine) תְּבוּנָה; or תּוֹבֻנָה; from H995 (בִּין);","def":"intelligence; by implication, an argument; by extension, caprice","kjv":"discretion, reason, skilfulness, understanding, wisdom.","count":42},"H8395":{"lemma":"תְּבוּסָה","xlit":"tᵉbûwçâh","pron":"teb-oo-saw'","from":"from H947 (בּוּס);","def":"a treading down, i.e. ruin","kjv":"destruction.","count":1},"H8396":{"lemma":"תָּבוֹר","xlit":"Tâbôwr","pron":"taw-bore'","from":"from a root corresponding to H8406 (תְּבַר); broken region;","def":"Tabor, a mountain in Palestine, also a city adjacent","kjv":"Tabor.","count":10},"H8397":{"lemma":"תֶּבֶל","xlit":"tebel","pron":"teh'-bel","from":"apparently from H1101 (בָּלַל);","def":"mixture, i.e. unnatural bestiality","kjv":"confusion.","count":2},"H8398":{"lemma":"תֵּבֵל","xlit":"têbêl","pron":"tay-bale'","from":"from H2986 (יָבַל);","def":"the earth (as moist and therefore inhabited); by extension, the globe; by implication, its inhabitants; specifically, a particular land, as Babylonia, Palestine","kjv":"habitable part, world.","count":36},"H8399":{"lemma":"תַּבְלִית","xlit":"tablîyth","pron":"tab-leeth'","from":"from H1086 (בָּלָה);","def":"consumption","kjv":"destruction.","count":1}}